            "placement": "right",
            "mobile_placement": "custom",
            "heading": "Shipping",
            "content": "<p>Welcome to VEYZARA Global, where we are committed to delivering a seamless and efficient shopping experience. Please familiarize yourself with our shipping policy to understand the intricacies of order delivery.</p><p><strong>Shipping Methods and Delivery Times:</strong></p><p>Within the contiguous INDIA, we offer the following shipping methods:</p><ul><li><br/><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong><br/><br/>Metros: 3-4 days<br/>Rest of India: 4-7 days<br/><br/></li></ul><p>Please note that delivery times are estimated and may be subject to unforeseen delays beyond our control.</p><p><strong>Shipping Costs:</strong></p><p>Shipping costs are dynamically calculated based on the weight, dimensions, and destination of your order. You will see the exact shipping charges at checkout before completing your purchase. Occasional free shipping promotions on prepaid orders will be clearly indicated on our website.</p><p><strong>Free Shipping:</strong></p><p>Free standard shipping is available for prepaid orders only. This promotion excludes oversized or heavy items requiring special handling.</p><p><strong>Order Processing Time:</strong></p><p>We process orders within 1-2 business days. Once shipped, you will receive a confirmation email containing tracking information.</p><p><strong>Tracking and Order Status:</strong></p><p>Track your order status on our \"Order Tracking\" page. Allow up to 24 hours for tracking information to become available after shipment. For any inquiries, contact our customer support team.</p><p><strong>Returns and Exchanges:</strong></p><p>Your satisfaction is our priority. Refer to our Returns and Exchanges page for detailed instructions. Please note, shipping costs for returns/exchanges are the customer's responsibility, unless due to a product defect or an error on our part.</p><p><strong>Lost or Damaged Shipments:</strong></p><p>If your shipment is lost or arrives damaged, contact our customer support team promptly. We will collaborate with the shipping carrier to resolve the issue. Please provide relevant details and photographs if possible.</p><p><strong>Customer Support:</strong></p><p>For inquiries or assistance with our shipping policy, our customer support team is available at veyzaraglobal@gmail.com.</p><p>Thank you for choosing VEYZARA Global. We are dedicated to providing a professional and enjoyable shopping experience for you.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open_default": false
          }
        },
